<title>USA: First Industrial sells Nashville property.</title>
<headline>First Industrial sells Nashville property.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Industrial Realty Trust Inc said Friday it has sold a 227,720 square foot light industrial property in Nashville, Tennessee, for $9.7 million.</p>
<p>The three building complex, located at 220 - 240 Great Circle Parkway, was 98 percent leased to 53 tenants at closing, the real estate investment trust said.</p>
<p>First Industrial shares fell 13/16 to 29-3/8 Friday.</p>
<p>	 ((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
